---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="For property owners" description="Aura Living helps Virginia property owners coordinate maintenance, communication, inspections, renewals, and reporting." path="/property-owners/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="For property owners" title="A steadier view of your property." intro="The right support should make ownership feel more informed, not more complicated. Aura Living helps coordinate the details and keep communication useful." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-grid">
      <div class="content-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Ownership, with context</span>
        <h2>Stay close without carrying every task.</h2>
        <p>Whether you are planning for a rental home or looking for a clearer way to manage the day-to-day, we focus on the work that keeps a property cared for and conversations moving.</p>
        <div class="feature-list">
          <div class="feature"><span class="feature-mark" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>Practical updates</h3><p>Receive the information needed to understand a request, its status, and the next step.</p></div></div>
          <div class="feature"><span class="feature-mark" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Coordinated care</h3><p>Bring maintenance, inspections, resident questions, and renewal timing into one organized view.</p></div></div>
          <div class="feature"><span class="feature-mark" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>Thoughtful communication</h3><p>Keep interactions direct and respectful for the people who own and live in the home.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="side-card"><h2>Start with the property.</h2><p>Every arrangement is a conversation about scope, priorities, and the kind of involvement that feels right to you.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Discuss your property</a></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section split-section"><div class="container split-grid"><div class="image-panel"><img src="/visuals/detail-home.svg" alt="Architectural illustration of a cared-for home" width="720" height="520" /></div><div class="split-card"><span class="eyebrow">A calmer operating rhythm</span><h3>Clear details. Considered follow-through.</h3><p>Aura Living is built around the belief that property support should feel human, organized, and easy to understand. We make space for the details that protect the experience of a home.</p></div></div></section>
  <CtaBand title="A clearer way to care for your property." />
</BaseLayout>
